+            // The sizing write above left all ones in the device's BAR
+            // register. vfio-pci virtualises BAR writes, but a vendor driver
+            // that emulates its own config space (NVIDIA vGPU) takes that
+            // value as the guest's BAR base and offsets every region access
+            // by it. Tell the device where the BAR really is, as QEMU does.
+            self.write_bar_to_device(bar_id, bar_addr.raw_value(), region_type, flags);
+
